Review the final diff after all fixes. Check for:

- accidental unrelated edits, commented-out code, temporary logging,
  unintentional TODO/FIXME markers, stale temporary tests or scripts;
- architecture drift;
- unapproved drift from `SPECIFICATION.md` or `CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md`, and stale
  code, tests, docs, or configuration after a `CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md` change;
- behavior that was verified manually but never preserved as a test.

#!/usr/bin/env node
// Claude Code PostToolUse hook for file edits (Edit, Write, MultiEdit).
//   CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md / SPECIFICATION.md -> synchronization reminder.
//   .csproj, Directory.Packages.props, package.json -> manifest check

if (rel === 'SPECIFICATION.md') {
  postToolContext(
    'SPECIFICATION.md changed: confirm it stays consistent with CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md (CLAUDE.md, Custom Settings) ' +
    'and carry approved behavior changes through the development-workflow.',
  );
}
